      ],
      "notes": "Dense activity/work-product rows, rich italic phase timing and paired deliverable previews remain legible. Bottom variable-scope copy stays above the footer; no clipping or accidental collision observed.",
      "artifact": "samples/visual-wave2/wave2-render/slide-002.png",
      "sha256": "dd40121dd347666b3175cb43292926015a3ab9be5fe1aba6092f5e6a5937b617",
      "independent_notes": [
        "Sidebar copy, four workstream activity/product rows, assumptions and variable-scope text fit their panels; no text is visibly cut off at the footer or right edge.",
        "The two deliverable image pairs retain source overlaps and captions remain attached visually to their respective pairs after the uniform composition transform. The images are small but legible as examples in this right-column slot.",
        "Assumptions panel and variable-scope copy fit; the last variable-scope line is close to the footer band but remains visibly above it."
      ],
      "independent_findings": []
    },
    {
