      "reviewed": true,
      "accepted": true,
      "scope": "bounded fixture visual acceptance; not full source pixel identity",
      "reviewers": [
        "primary",
        "independent Luna"
      ],
      "notes": "Source portrait crops retain proportions. Native-read roster name/role glyph starts align with the card. Rectangular contain and cover variants visibly differ; text boxes remain a deliberate structural approximation of the source paragraph.",
      "artifact": "samples/visual-wave2/wave2-render/slide-003.png",
      "sha256": "57c9f2d78c8091f43ae5946be6946735a7e96bf4a63e2fb87dc4dc72b2a0b491",
      "independent_notes": [
        "The UHG44 source portrait crop and card treatment are visible; Cam name/role glyphs align in the card. The control uses separate name/role boxes at measured glyph starts and explicitly does not claim the original single-paragraph structure.",
        "UHG67 portrait crop is face-centered and matches the source crop treatment. The 76\u00d752 contain/cover samples visibly differ; cover uses the declared upper-center focal point.",
        "The long explanatory note wraps within its pale panel and does not clip. Footer and slide number are intact."
      ],
      "independent_findings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "synthetic-profile",
      "reviewed": true,
      "accepted": true,
      "scope": "bounded fixture visual acceptance; not full source pixel identity",
      "reviewers": [
        "primary",
        "independent Luna"
      ],
      "notes": "All rich bio paragraphs and side-panel content fit. Bold/italic/blue inline emphasis and underline survive. Unequal minimum block heights leave uneven bullet spacing in the first sidebar; this is a recorded polish limitation, not clipping.",
      "artifact": "samples/visual-wave2/wave2-render/slide-004.png",
      "sha256": "b231c784f25bc0fbbe48c7e18d84f31b1e2d24f313c817ecd0e4b73128e7e6e1",
      "independent_notes": [
        "Title, synthetic disclaimer, initials, name/role, bio text and both right panels are fully visible. Rich emphasis and underlined headings render; no collisions or text clipping observed.",
        "The middle bio column ends well above the bottom of its available zone, and the second expertise panel has substantial unused lower space. It is visually lighter than source UHG67 but is not an overflow or clipping failure.",
        "Bullet gaps vary slightly, especially between wrapped and single-line items. Treat as spacing polish, not a fit failure."
      ],
      "independent_findings": [
        "Polish: bio column and lower expertise panel are sparse versus the denser UHG67 reference; regularize bullet spacing if further content/layout tuning is in scope."
      ]
    },
